SUMMARY:Blank at Prima
DESCRIPTION:A ____ experience\, never repeated. \nA guest performer walks onstage having never seen the script. They discover it for the first time along with the audience. Plus\, one more surprise waiting: the script is full of blanks. \nThat’s where you come in. \nWith help from the audience\, the performer fills in the story in real time. Every performance features a new person on stage and a completely one-of-a-kind experience shaped by the people who are present. \nMoving\, funny\, and unforgettable. \nDon’t miss the regional premiere everyone will be talking about. \nProduced by special permission of writer Nassim Soleimanpour. \nGet Tickets \n \nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
