SUMMARY:Happy Hauntings at Dutch Wonderland
DESCRIPTION:Happy Hauntings at Dutch Wonderland brings Halloween magic to life—without the scares. Bring the whole family for kid-friendly\, lively entertainment packed with silly\, not-spooky fun around every corner. Happy Hauntings is a delightful- not frightful – way to celebrate Halloween together. \nBuy a 2027 Gold or Platinum Pass now and get this year’s Happy Hauntings FREE! Save up to $60 and enjoy more than a year of unlimited admission and royal perks. \nLooking to stay at our Dutch Wonderland Inn and play all day? Check out our special Happy Hauntings Packages
