SUMMARY:Shamrocks & Shenanigans at the PA Renaissance Faire
DESCRIPTION:Wrap on your kilt\, grab your shillelagh\, and hold on to your potatoes & dash; the Celtic nations have come to revel in Mount Hope! \nEnjoy a good stout\, a scotch egg\, and show off your calves all weekend long. \nNote: This is NOT the Celtic Fling & Highland Games event that occurs in June. \n\nSee our schedule of Fairs & Festivals in Lancaster County and surrounding areas.\nOther Things To Do in Lancaster\, PA\n\n\nArt Galleries\nDistilleries\nEscape Rooms\nFactory Tours\n\n\n\nIndoor Things To Do\nMassage and Spas\nOutdoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nShooting Ranges\nTheaters\nWineries\nAll Things To Do in Lancaster
